{"cover":{"src":"audio/garden/cover.m4a","text":"The Garden.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":2.125,"words":[{"w":"The","s":0.65,"e":0.75},{"w":"Garden","s":0.75,"e":1.525}]},"eden-title":{"src":"audio/garden/eden-title.m4a","text":"Part One. The Garden of Eden.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.275,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.85},{"w":"One","s":0.85,"e":1.3},{"w":"The","s":1.425,"e":1.525},{"w":"Garden","s":1.525,"e":1.887},{"w":"of","s":1.887,"e":2},{"w":"Eden","s":2,"e":2.675}]},"eden-0":{"src":"audio/garden/eden-0.m4a","text":"God planted a beautiful garden in a place called Eden, full of trees with delicious fruit, and a sparkling river to water it all.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.3,"words":[{"w":"God","s":0.625,"e":1.012},{"w":"planted","s":1.012,"e":1.413},{"w":"a","s":1.413,"e":1.488},{"w":"beautiful","s":1.488,"e":1.975},{"w":"garden","s":1.975,"e":2.375},{"w":"in","s":2.375,"e":2.462},{"w":"a","s":2.462,"e":2.525},{"w":"place","s":2.525,"e":2.875},{"w":"called","s":2.875,"e":3.188},{"w":"Eden","s":3.188,"e":3.9},{"w":"full","s":4.037,"e":4.263},{"w":"of","s":4.263,"e":4.388},{"w":"trees","s":4.388,"e":4.925},{"w":"with","s":4.925,"e":5.1},{"w":"delicious","s":5.1,"e":5.688},{"w":"fruit","s":5.688,"e":6.35},{"w":"and","s":6.45,"e":6.562},{"w":"a","s":6.562,"e":6.638},{"w":"sparkling","s":6.638,"e":7.225},{"w":"river","s":7.225,"e":7.55},{"w":"to","s":7.55,"e":7.675},{"w":"water","s":7.675,"e":8.012},{"w":"it","s":8.012,"e":8.1},{"w":"all","s":8.1,"e":8.725}]},"eden-1":{"src":"audio/garden/eden-1.m4a","text":"He put Adam in the garden to take care of it. Adam could eat from any tree — except one: the tree of the knowledge of good and evil.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.55,"words":[{"w":"He","s":0.575,"e":0.7},{"w":"put","s":0.7,"e":0.938},{"w":"Adam","s":0.938,"e":1.262},{"w":"in","s":1.262,"e":1.337},{"w":"the","s":1.337,"e":1.425},{"w":"garden","s":1.425,"e":1.825},{"w":"to","s":1.825,"e":1.925},{"w":"take","s":1.925,"e":2.175},{"w":"care","s":2.175,"e":2.413},{"w":"of","s":2.413,"e":2.525},{"w":"it","s":2.525,"e":3.1},{"w":"Adam","s":3.275,"e":3.65},{"w":"could","s":3.65,"e":3.825},{"w":"eat","s":3.825,"e":4.075},{"w":"from","s":4.075,"e":4.275},{"w":"any","s":4.275,"e":4.537},{"w":"tree","s":4.537,"e":5.088},{"w":"except","s":5.175,"e":5.575},{"w":"one","s":5.575,"e":6.225},{"w":"the","s":6.375,"e":6.513},{"w":"tree","s":6.513,"e":6.825},{"w":"of","s":6.825,"e":6.912},{"w":"the","s":6.912,"e":7.025},{"w":"knowledge","s":7.025,"e":7.5},{"w":"of","s":7.5,"e":7.675},{"w":"good","s":7.675,"e":8.088},{"w":"and","s":8.088,"e":8.238},{"w":"evil","s":8.238,"e":8.975}]},"naming-title":{"src":"audio/garden/naming-title.m4a","text":"Part Two. Naming the Animals.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.375,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.887},{"w":"Two","s":0.887,"e":1.35},{"w":"Naming","s":1.512,"e":1.837},{"w":"the","s":1.837,"e":1.95},{"w":"Animals","s":1.95,"e":2.8}]},"naming-0":{"src":"audio/garden/naming-0.m4a","text":"God brought every animal and bird to Adam, to see what he would call them. And whatever Adam called each one — that was its name!","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.2,"words":[{"w":"God","s":0.625,"e":0.95},{"w":"brought","s":0.95,"e":1.262},{"w":"every","s":1.262,"e":1.637},{"w":"animal","s":1.637,"e":2.138},{"w":"and","s":2.138,"e":2.312},{"w":"bird","s":2.312,"e":2.6},{"w":"to","s":2.6,"e":2.737},{"w":"Adam","s":2.737,"e":3.35},{"w":"to","s":3.45,"e":3.575},{"w":"see","s":3.575,"e":3.775},{"w":"what","s":3.775,"e":3.925},{"w":"he","s":3.925,"e":4.075},{"w":"would","s":4.075,"e":4.225},{"w":"call","s":4.225,"e":4.5},{"w":"them","s":4.5,"e":5.225},{"w":"And","s":5.35,"e":5.525},{"w":"whatever","s":5.525,"e":5.987},{"w":"Adam","s":5.987,"e":6.325},{"w":"called","s":6.325,"e":6.588},{"w":"each","s":6.588,"e":6.825},{"w":"one","s":6.825,"e":7.312},{"w":"that","s":7.4,"e":7.562},{"w":"was","s":7.562,"e":7.7},{"w":"its","s":7.7,"e":7.9},{"w":"name","s":7.9,"e":8.625}]},"naming-1":{"src":"audio/garden/naming-1.m4a","text":"But none of the animals was just right to be Adam’s partner.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":4.8,"words":[{"w":"But","s":0.575,"e":0.713},{"w":"none","s":0.713,"e":0.912},{"w":"of","s":0.912,"e":0.988},{"w":"the","s":0.988,"e":1.137},{"w":"animals","s":1.137,"e":1.988},{"w":"was","s":1.988,"e":2.2},{"w":"just","s":2.2,"e":2.45},{"w":"right","s":2.45,"e":2.725},{"w":"to","s":2.725,"e":2.812},{"w":"be","s":2.812,"e":3},{"w":"Adam's","s":3,"e":3.4},{"w":"partner","s":3.4,"e":4.2}]},"eve-title":{"src":"audio/garden/eve-title.m4a","text":"Part Three. God Makes Eve.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.225,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.875},{"w":"Three","s":0.875,"e":1.3},{"w":"God","s":1.438,"e":1.712},{"w":"Makes","s":1.712,"e":1.975},{"w":"Eve","s":1.975,"e":2.625}]},"eve-0":{"src":"audio/garden/eve-0.m4a","text":"So God made Adam fall into a deep sleep. And from Adam’s side, God made a woman: Eve.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":7.15,"words":[{"w":"So","s":0.625,"e":0.8},{"w":"God","s":0.8,"e":1.087},{"w":"made","s":1.087,"e":1.275},{"w":"Adam","s":1.275,"e":1.613},{"w":"fall","s":1.613,"e":1.863},{"w":"into","s":1.863,"e":2.075},{"w":"a","s":2.075,"e":2.175},{"w":"deep","s":2.175,"e":2.438},{"w":"sleep","s":2.438,"e":3.125},{"w":"And","s":3.25,"e":3.4},{"w":"from","s":3.4,"e":3.587},{"w":"Adam's","s":3.587,"e":3.962},{"w":"side","s":3.962,"e":4.45},{"w":"God","s":4.562,"e":4.862},{"w":"made","s":4.862,"e":5.037},{"w":"a","s":5.037,"e":5.1},{"w":"woman","s":5.1,"e":5.675},{"w":"Eve","s":5.838,"e":6.55}]},"eve-1":{"src":"audio/garden/eve-1.m4a","text":"When Adam saw her, he was so happy! “At last — someone just like me!” And God brought them together.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":7.45,"words":[{"w":"When","s":0.6,"e":0.738},{"w":"Adam","s":0.738,"e":1.087},{"w":"saw","s":1.087,"e":1.35},{"w":"her","s":1.35,"e":1.55},{"w":"he","s":1.6,"e":1.75},{"w":"was","s":1.